        " اَلْمَنَامِ مَا يَرَى اَلرَّجُلُ قَالَ «إِنْ أَنْزَلَتْ فَعَلَيْهَا اَلْغُسْلُ وَ إِنْ لَمْ تُنْزِلْ فَلَيْسَ عَلَيْهَا غُسْلٌ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.190 - (Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) ) was asked regarding a woman who sees in her dream what a man sees (i.e., a sexual dream).\nImam (as) said: 'If She has a discharge, ghusl (ritual bathing) is obligatory for her; but if She does not have a discharge, then ghusl is not required.'\""
        ]
      }
